is exactly the canonical owner theorem `AlgEquiv.prodQuotientOfIsIdempotentElem`, specialized to
`S = B ⧸ Ideal.map (algebraMap A B) I`,
`e = Ideal.Quotient.mk (Ideal.map (algebraMap A B) I) b`, and
`f = 1 - Ideal.Quotient.mk (Ideal.map (algebraMap A B) I) b`. -/
@[stacks 0EM5 "product decomposition from an idempotent"]
#check AlgEquiv.prodQuotientOfIsIdempotentElem
